r←testArrowConversionRuntime;req;err;msg;args;types;names
⎕CS ##
⍝ Runtime smoke tests for Arrow conversion APIs without Arrow struct marshalling.
⍝ We intentionally pass null pointers and verify structured error_data lifecycle.

:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf

req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test Arrow Conversion API (runtime null-smoke)'

⍝ to_arrow_schema(null-input) should return error_data handle and error flag.
types←⍬
names←⍬
args←0 types names 0 0
err←toArrowSchema args
r,←⊂'toArrowSchema(null) returned error_data handle' req err≠0
:If err≠0
    r,←⊂'toArrowSchema(null) has error flag' req 1=api.duckdb_error_data_has_error err
    msg←512 read.utf8 api.duckdb_error_data_message err
    r,←⊂'toArrowSchema(null) error message available' req 0<≢msg
    {}api.duckdb_destroy_error_data ⊂err
:EndIf

⍝ data_chunk_to_arrow(null-input) should return error_data handle and error flag.
args←0 0 0
err←dataChunkToArrow args
r,←⊂'dataChunkToArrow(null) returned error_data handle' req err≠0
:If err≠0
    r,←⊂'dataChunkToArrow(null) has error flag' req 1=api.duckdb_error_data_has_error err
    msg←512 read.utf8 api.duckdb_error_data_message err
    r,←⊂'dataChunkToArrow(null) error message available' req 0<≢msg
    {}api.duckdb_destroy_error_data ⊂err
:EndIf

r,←⊂''
r,←⊂'Arrow conversion runtime null-smoke complete!'
⎕←↑r

